  "title": "Skillet Beef and Celery",
  "description": "This family classic of beef chuck slices sauteed with onions and celery and flavored with soy sauce has been a hit for more than 30 years. Even your kids will like this one. Serve over rice.",
  "authors": [
    "Vicki Haddy"
  ],
